msgstr ""

#: includes/class-epfr-admin.php
msgid "French Addon"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-epfr-admin.php
msgid "ElasticPress French Addon"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-epfr-admin.php
msgid "Any change below only applies to new indexes. A full reindex is required after saving:"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-epfr-admin.php
msgid "While the addon is enabled, the stopwords list is forced to _french_, regardless of the ElasticPress Language setting."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-epfr-admin.php
msgid "ElasticPress French Addon is active: the stopwords list is forced to <code>_french_</code>, regardless of the Language setting below. <a href=\"%s\">Manage French Addon settings</a>."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-epfr-admin.php
msgid "Addon enabled"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-epfr-admin.php
msgid "Apply French corrections to the ElasticPress analyzer"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-epfr-admin.php
msgid "Asciifolding"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-epfr-admin.php
msgid "Ignore accents at index and search time (recommended: \"haiti\" and \"haïti\" should return the same results)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-epfr-admin.php
msgid "Elision"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-epfr-admin.php
msgid "Handle French elision (l'article, d'un, qu'il…)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-epfr-admin.php
msgid "Stemmer"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-epfr-admin.php
msgid "None (exact matches only)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-epfr-admin.php
msgid "Minimal (obvious plurals only)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-epfr-admin.php
msgid "Light (recommended — plurals, feminine forms, simple conjugations)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-epfr-admin.php
msgid "Full Snowball (aggressive — risk of collisions between distinct words)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-epfr-admin.php
msgid "The \"Full Snowball\" stemmer often truncates words to 4–5 letters and can return unrelated results (e.g. \"haine\" and \"haute\" confused with \"Haïti\"). \"Light\" is the best compromise for most sites."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-epfr-admin.php
msgid "Fuzziness (typo tolerance)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-epfr-admin.php
msgid "Auto (ElasticPress default)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-epfr-admin.php
msgid "0 — Disabled (strict matching)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-epfr-admin.php
msgid "1 — Tolerate one typo"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-epfr-admin.php
msgid "2 — Tolerate two typos"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-epfr-admin.php
msgid "Lower this only if asciifolding and the light stemmer are not enough to remove noise from results."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-epfr-admin.php
msgid "Additional stopwords"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-epfr-admin.php
msgid "Comma-separated list of words to ignore on top of the <a href=\"%1$s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">standard French stopword list</a> (see also the <a href=\"%2$s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">direct Lucene source file</a>) (e.g. company name if too frequent in content)."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-epfr-admin.php
msgid "Stem exclusion"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-epfr-admin.php
msgid "Comma-separated words that must not be stemmed (keyword_marker). Classic example: exclude \"croix\" so a search for \"croissant\" does not match the brand \"La Croix\". Has no effect when Stemmer is set to None."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-epfr-admin.php
msgid "Dual analyzers (light / heavy)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-epfr-admin.php
msgid "Use a light analyzer on main text fields (precision) and a heavy stemmed analyzer on .stemmed multi-fields (recall)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-epfr-admin.php
msgid "Inspired by the dual french_light / french_heavy approach. Applies to the posts index only (post_title, post_content, post_excerpt). Other indexables (terms, comments, users) keep a full stemmed chain. Search queries automatically include the .stemmed fields at a lower boost. Has no effect when Stemmer is set to None. Requires a full reindex."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-epfr-admin.php
msgid "Verify the result"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-epfr-admin.php
msgid "After reindexing, test the analyzer directly via the Elasticsearch API:"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-epfr-admin.php
msgid "All three forms should produce the same token."
msgstr ""

#: elasticpress-french-addon.php
msgid "Fixes and optimizes the ElasticPress analyzer for French: asciifolding, elision, configurable stemmer, extra stopwords, fuzziness. Notably fixes the classic bug where accent-free searches return unrelated results."
msgstr ""
